      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Evelyn Marston:</b> The forwarded alert urges action within 24 hours. Its displayed sender address is <b>notifications@summit-trust.secure-mail.com</b>. Record the domain the lookup parses before drawing any conclusion about the sender.",
      "taskInstructions": "Open the browser, search <b>netlookup</b> in Cyber Search, and open <b>NetLookup: Domain &amp; Host Lookup</b>. Enter <b>notifications@summit-trust.secure-mail.com</b>, then type the exact <b>Parsed domain</b> shown in the result.",
      "taskQuestion": "What parsed domain does NetLookup show for the alert address?",
      "taskCompleteText": "<b>Evelyn Marston:</b> The parsed domain is <b>summit-trust.secure-mail.com</b>. NetLookup lists SecureMail Hosting Ltd as the registrant; that record does not establish who wrote the message."
